   "markdown": "# p_09c6 \u2014 Nothing travels; both residents are home-based or the objects are decoys\n\nThis is a contrarian hypothesis: the keys, wallet, water bottle, and laptop seen at the entry are NOT taken to work. Yuki may work from home on some days, or the \"office in town\" is a misread. Omar's tablet and bike lock never leave. The objects at the entry are simply where they are stored permanently. What sets this hypothesis apart: keys_yuki, wallet_yuki, and water_bottle_yuki are ALWAYS in the house, at the entry, 24/7. What would refute it: any of keys_yuki, wallet_yuki, water_bottle_yuki, or laptop_yuki sighted OUT_OF_HOUSE on any day.\n\n```json\n{\n \"claims\": [\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Yuki's keys are at the entry floor at all times\",\n   \"target\": \"keys_yuki\",\n   \"expect\": \"entry_floor_e1\",\n   \"days\": \"both\",\n   \"from\": 0,\n   \"to\": 24\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Yuki's wallet is at the entry table at all times\",\n   \"target\": \"wallet_yuki\",\n   \"expect\": \"entry_table_e1\",\n   \"days\": \"both\",\n   \"from\": 0,\n   \"to\": 24\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Omar's tablet is at the kitchen chair at all times\",\n   \"target\": \"tablet_omar\",\n   \"expect\": \"chair_k1\",\n   \"days\": \"both\",\n   \"from\": 0,\n   \"to\": 24\n  },\n  {\n   \"claim\": \"Yuki's water bottle is at the entry hook at all times\",\n   \"target\": \"water_bottle_yuki\",\n   \"expect\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n   \"days\": \"both\",\n   \"from\": 0,\n   \"to\": 24\n  }\n ],\n \"targets\": {\n  \"keys_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_floor_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"wallet_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_table_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"water_bottle_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"laptop_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"backpack_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"notebook_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"tablet_omar\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"chair_k1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"bike_lock_omar\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_table_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"bike_lock_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_table_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"helmet_omar\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"helmet_yuki\": [\n   {\n    \"days\": \"both\",\n    \"from\": 0,\n    \"to\": 24,\n    \"at\": \"entry_hook_e1\",\n    \"chance\": \"almost_always\"\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n```\n"
